lidation artifacts,\n+  and final experimental result data.\n+keywords:\n+  - \"CPU\u2013FPGA co-design\"\n+  - \"FPGA acceleration\"\n+  - \"CVRP\"\n+  - \"local search\"\n+  - \"profiling-guided acceleration\"\n+  - \"design-space exploration\"\n+  - \"Vitis HLS\""}]}